      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why this composes with ZeRO-2 (DeepSpeed magic):",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why this composes with ZeRO-2 (DeepSpeed magic):",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JJkJXBjJ3XcOQRMtOSoNY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 3726,
      "width": 798,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "fR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 665182721,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1124483430,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Every expert weight gets stamped:  param.allreduce = False  +  param.group_name = 'ep_size_8'",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Every expert weight gets stamped:  param.allreduce = False  +  param.group_name = 'ep_size_8'",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RR8HpJCl5mv4cYdZgiYP4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 3748,
      "width": 604.8,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "fS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1340934597,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 661614004,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  (deepspeed/moe/experts.py — the ONLY two attributes that do the trick)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  (deepspeed/moe/experts.py — the ONLY two attributes that do the trick)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PExx3zSQ-EfD0irIP37QF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 3770,
      "width": 789.6,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "fT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 684487000,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1642924623,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• ZeRO-2 engine checks is_moe_param(p) → routes its grad AllReduce to expert_dp_process_group,",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• ZeRO-2 engine checks is_moe_param(p) → routes its grad AllReduce to expert_dp_process_group,",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Dqu-Ci2HO9vA48DFFx1vx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 3792,
      "width": 848.4,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "fU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 261827898,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1145738296,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  not the full DP group.  At ep_size = world_size = 8 that group has size 1 → grad AllReduce skipped.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  not the full DP group.  At ep_size = world_size = 8 that group has size 1 → grad AllReduce skipped.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pFrjo9-FHZ1s1Cn5pnVum",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 3814,
      "width": 781.1999999999999,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "fV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1891623223,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2142634984,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Optimizer states for expert params are sharded only within that smaller group → 1/G memory.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Optimizer states for expert params are sharded only within that smaller group → 1/G memory.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xTTLCpcjjMAKxK5BSLQMh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 3836,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "fW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2019027982,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 710766431,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773529200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Non-expert params (attention, qkv, norms, router wg) follow the standard ZeRO-2 DP path unchanged.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Non-expert params (attention, qkv, norms, router wg) follow the standard ZeRO-2 DP path unchanged.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
